## File structure = Build files created by Steven B. & Dr. Kyunsun Choi

 `draw_bitmap_multiwindow.c/h` = GTK4 multi-window bitmap display (professor-provided) 
`wait_key.c/h` = Non-blocking keypress detection (professor-provided) 
`pixel_format_RGB.h` = RGB pixel struct (professor-provided) 
 `Makefile` = Build rules 


## Competition notes

- Tested under lab lighting and recalibrated on-site for ballroom lighting conditions
- Sensor mounted horizontally on robot chassis, facing the plant slot
- Detection stable on moving chassis with 4-frame temporal filter + debounce layer
- Blob-counting approach is lighting-independent (distance only, no color)


## Related systems (team)

- Line-following (camera + IR sensors) — navigation
- Motor control — PWM drive
- Camera color detection — yellow plant identification
- Robotic arm actuation — yellow plant removal


